# The overview with the presenter window open (spec 26): it is shown there, the audience keeps the slide.
# (Scripts have no second window: the presenter view, here the grid, takes the main window's place.)
size 1000 640
open speaker.md
keys f5
keys s
keys o
shot grid.png
keys right
keys enter
shot picked.png
keys s
keys o
shot main-grid.png
